{
  "schema": 1,
  "name": "Profession hats halve the matching gathering or crafting cast time (#4824)",
  "contract": [
    "#4824 reports profession hats failing to speed gathering/crafting. This covers two of its eleven items:",
    "Herbalist's Hat 1004000 and Alchemist's Hat 1004003. Their effective item_template rows grant equip-trigger",
    "spells of the same IDs. Original CoA Spell.dbc describes faster gathering/alchemy and defines -50% casting-",
    "time modifiers: aura108, op10, BasePoints-51 plus DieSides1. Original SpellAffect.dbc row18061 pairs 1004000",
    "with Herb Gathering2366; row37039 pairs 1004003 with Minor Healing Potion2330. Crossed pairs are absent.",
    "Both target spells use SpellCastTimes row14, 3000ms. The manifest agrees with the extracted files: Spell.dbc",
    "SHA256 d3dd607291d2d6793f72c7b13537f94fd7748d40a79a326db6a8b4cb2ed41068 from patch-T.MPQ.ORIGINAL;",
    "SpellAffect.dbc SHA256 bddf0363c94558a8564681224a8c3e0e359d9eef4b5ba450b7a7a215e9cf02be from patch-S.MPQ.",
    "Its reviewed native layout is SpellAffectEntry/SpellAffectfmt nii. AscensionProfessionSpellAffect already",
    "routes these pairs through the native modifier check, so this is a regression of working behavior with no",
    "gameplay fix. Ordinary-security level20 Warrior actors learn Apprentice Herbalism/Alchemy and the recipe as",
    "fixtures, with skills1/75. Real hats are granted and equipped through the native handler. The test checks",
    "the equip aura and server CalcCastTime: matching duration halves, crossed profession stays unchanged, native",
    "destruction clears the aura and restores both durations. Item granting is fixture acquisition, not a",
    "Bazaar/vendor test. This does not measure cast completion, gather yields, crafted items, client tooltips or",
    "rendered cast bars. The other nine reported hats remain outside this scenario."
  ],
  "timeout_ms": 60000,
